What this repository contains
-----------------------------
- overlay/, patches/, android/, windows/, scripts/: original work for this
  project, GPL-2.0-or-later.
- Built artifacts (the Android APK, the Windows exe, cross-built crawl
  binaries) contain unmodified or patched DCSS code. The corresponding source is the upstream
  crawl commit named by scripts/setup.sh and scripts/crossbuild-*.sh plus the
  files in patches/. Anyone receiving a binary may obtain that source from
  this repository and from upstream.

